&#160;Hazardous materials within piping shall not be included in the calculated quantities.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-167899\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-167899\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;Quantity of hazardous materials in a single fabrication shall not exceed the maximum allowable quantities per control area in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-166067', hash: '#JD_BCTable307.1(1)' }}\">Tables 307.1(1)<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-166067', hash: '#JD_BCTable307.1(2)' }}\">307.1(2)<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-167900\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-167900\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tc.&#160;&#160;&#160;Densely packed baled cotton that complies with the packing requirements of ISO 8115 shall not be included in this material class.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-167901\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-167901\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\td.&#160;&#160;&#160;The aggregate quantity of flammable, pyrophoric, toxic and highly toxic gases shall not exceed 9,000 cubic feet at NTP.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-167902\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-167902\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\te.&#160;&#160;&#160;The aggregate quantity of pyrophoric gases in the building shall not exceed the amounts set forth in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-167818', hash: '#JD_BCTable415.6.2' }}\">Table 415.6.2<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "664-html-3",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "For SI: 1 pound per square foot = 4.882 kg\/m 2 , 1 gallon per square foot = 40.7 L\/m 2 , 1 cubic foot @ NTP\/square foot = 0.305 m\n\n 3 @ NTP\/m 2 , 1 cubic foot = 0.02832 m\n\n 3 \n\n a. Hazardous materials within piping shall not be included in the calculated quantities.\n\n b. Quantity of hazardous materials in a single fabrication shall not exceed the maximum allowable quantities per control area in Tables 307.1(1) and 307.1(2) .\n\n c. Densely packed baled cotton that complies with the packing requirements of ISO 8115 shall not be included in this material class.\n\n d. The aggregate quantity of flammable, pyrophoric, toxic and highly toxic gases shall not exceed 9,000 cubic feet at NTP.\n\n e. The aggregate quantity of pyrophoric gases in the building shall not exceed the amounts set forth in Table 415.6.2 ."
